'''Catfruit Jubilee''' is a [[Continuation Stage]] accessible from any stage in [[Growing Catfruit]]. When cleared, it can drop a [[Catfruit]] or Catfruit Seed at a 100% chance and has a higher chance for an Epic Catfruit. It was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

