==Strategy==
This stage's strategy is dependent on the [[Catfruit]] stage you come from, But a general strategy is to use whatever units that  are already in your lineup.

Any unit with [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]] or [[Wave Shield]] may be useful, but are usually not needed, as [[Kory]]'s waves can be mitigated with basic meatshielding.

